WEBVTT

00:01:29.168 --> 00:01:31.879
but I want to take it with me
out into the real world.

00:01:31.921 --> 00:01:33.214
So let's do that.

00:01:36.676 --> 00:01:38.302
This is (Never) Lonely Boy.

00:01:38.302 --> 00:01:40.805
He's sitting in the abandoned
lot by himself,

00:01:40.847 --> 00:01:43.224
until he's surrounded
by his virtual friends.

00:01:44.725 --> 00:01:49.313
Now, what if those virtual friends
could join me here on the TED stage?

00:01:50.064 --> 00:01:51.691
(Audience cheers)

00:01:52.567 --> 00:01:53.943
Oh, bam!

00:01:54.485 --> 00:01:56.404
Hey, little buddies.

00:01:56.445 --> 00:01:59.991
Now, ideally, we'd all be wearing
augmented reality glasses,